+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Higher values smooth the model target but can delay response. For Porter II EV and Ioniq 5 HDA2 CAMERA SCC torque steering on the laneless path, the extra 0.1s controller filter is omitted at or below 30km/h and blended back between 30 and 40km/h.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+The model filter controlled by this setting remains. Lane mode and operation at or above 40km/h retain their existing response; compare one steering setting at a time.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN REFERENCE -->
+### Reference
+
+Maximum torque, rate and driver-override limits are not raised. Earlier target delivery and actual wheel tracking or lane keeping require separate verification.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END REFERENCE -->
+
